Magic maps io.EOF -> ErrEmpty and io.ErrUnexpectedEOF -> ErrBadMagic with a value
switch on the io.ReadFull result and returns the rest. Expected: sentinels
source.ErrEmpty and source.ErrBadMagic, io.ErrShortBuffer (from ReadAtLeast), and the
Read errors of the Candidates for parameter r ((*os.File).Read from Peek,
(*strings.Reader).Read from main). io.EOF and io.ErrUnexpectedEOF must NOT appear
unwrapped.
-- args --
source/source.go:@magic
